# PMS

- Staff ops only. Talk to `apps/api` only — no OTA calls in the browser.
- Prioritize calendar, reservations, check-in/out, quick-confirm.
- Quick-confirm: pre-filled draft → Confirm → save.
- Read `apps/pms/AGENTS.md` for Phase 1 screens.
